            "q": "(vii) How will you differentiate between representative and transition elements?",
            "ans": "Answer:\n1. Representative Elements (Main Group Elements):\n• Belong to s-block and p-block (Groups IA to VIIIA).\n• Have their outermost s or p subshells incompletely filled or filled.\n• Show fixed valencies and regular periodic trends.\n2. Transition Elements:\n• Belong to d-block (Groups IIIB to IIB) and f-block (inner transition).\n• Have incompletely filled d or f inner subshells.\n• Show variable oxidation states/valencies, form colored compounds, and act as industrial catalysts.",
