            "ans": "Answer:\nSulphur (S, Z = 16) is a REPRESENTATIVE ELEMENT.\nReason:\nIts electronic configuration is 1s^2 2s^2 2p^6 3s^2 3p^4. The outermost electrons are filling the 3p subshell, placing it in the p-block (Group VIA / 16, Period 3). All p-block elements are representative elements.",
