          "num": "Project Work",
          "name": "Project Work",
          "procedure": "Prepare a report on the work of Linus Pauling. Discuss his work on the nature of the chemical bond.",
          "sourceUnprintedSupplementaryText": "Source prompt: Prepare a report on the work of Linus Pauling. Discuss his work on the nature of the chemical bond.\n\nSpaceBook-authored research notes:\nResearch Report on Linus Pauling:\n• Linus Pauling (1901–1994) was an American chemist awarded the Nobel Prize in Chemistry in 1954 for his research into the nature of the chemical bond.\n• Key Contributions:\n1. Introduced the concept of Electronegativity and developed the Pauling Electronegativity Scale (assigning Fluorine 4.0).\n2. Developed the concept of Orbital Hybridization (sp, sp2, sp3) to explain molecular shapes and bond angles (e.g. tetrahedral methane).\n3. Formulated Resonance Theory to explain structures that cannot be represented by a single Lewis formula (e.g. benzene, carbonate ion).\n4. Applied quantum mechanics to chemical bonding, bridging the gap between physics and chemistry in his monumental 1939 book 'The Nature of the Chemical Bond'.",
          "id": "chem9-unit4-project-source120",
          "title": "Project Work",
          "sourcePromptPair": {
            "text": "Prepare a report on the work of Linus Pauling. Discuss his work on the nature of the chemical bond.",
            "urdu": "لائنس پالنگ کے کام پر رپورٹ تیار کریں۔ کیمیائی بند کی نوعیت کے بارے میں ان کے کام پر بحث کریں۔",
            "pashto": "د لینوس پاولینګ د کار په اړه راپور چمتو کړئ. د کیمیاوي اړیکې د ماهیت په اړه یې کار وڅېړئ."
          },
