                {
                  "text": "M₂ = M₁V₁ / V₂ = (2.5 × 30) / 280 = 0.267M",
                  "urdu": "M₂ = M₁V₁ / V₂ = (2.5 × 30) / 280 = 0.267M",
                  "pashto": "M₂ = M₁V₁ / V₂ = (2.5 × 30) / 280 = 0.267M",
                  "sourcePdf": "D:/SpaceBook/Books/9th/9th Chemistry/pdf/chemistry4(1).pdf",
                  "sourcePdfPage": 14,
                  "sourcePrintedPage": 165
                },
                {
                  "text": "EXAMPLE: 6.5",
                  "urdu": "مثال: 6.5",
                  "pashto": "بېلګه: 6.5",
                  "sourcePdf": "D:/SpaceBook/Books/9th/9th Chemistry/pdf/chemistry4(1).pdf",
                  "sourcePdfPage": 14,
                  "sourcePrintedPage": 165
                },
                {
                  "text": "What volume of water must be added to 85 cm³ of 3.5 M Na₂CO₃ to dilute it to 0.41 M?",
                  "urdu": "3.5 M Na₂CO₃ کے 85 cm³ کو 0.41 M تک رقیق کرنے کے لیے کتنا پانی شامل کرنا چاہیے؟",
                  "pashto": "د 3.5 M Na₂CO₃ د 85 cm³ د رقیقولو لپاره تر 0.41 M پورې د اوبو څومره حجم باید ورزیات شي؟",
                  "sourcePdf": "D:/SpaceBook/Books/9th/9th Chemistry/pdf/chemistry4(1).pdf",
                  "sourcePdfPage": 14,
                  "sourcePrintedPage": 165
                },
                {
                  "text": "Solution: M₁ = 3.5M, V₁ = 85cm³, M₂ = 0.41M, V₂ = ?",
                  "urdu": "حل: M₁ = 3.5M، V₁ = 85cm³، M₂ = 0.41M، V₂ = ؟",
                  "pashto": "حل: M₁ = 3.5M، V₁ = 85cm³، M₂ = 0.41M، V₂ = ؟",
                  "sourcePdf": "D:/SpaceBook/Books/9th/9th Chemistry/pdf/chemistry4(1).pdf",
                  "sourcePdfPage": 14,
                  "sourcePrintedPage": 165
                },
                {
                  "text": "Or we can write, M₁V₁ = M₂V₂",
                  "urdu": "یا لکھ سکتے ہیں، M₁V₁ = M₂V₂",
                  "pashto": "یا لیکلای شو، M₁V₁ = M₂V₂",
                  "sourcePdf": "D:/SpaceBook/Books/9th/9th Chemistry/pdf/chemistry4(1).pdf",
                  "sourcePdfPage": 14,
                  "sourcePrintedPage": 165
                },
                {
                  "text": "M₂V₂ = M₁V₁",
                  "urdu": "M₂V₂ = M₁V₁",
                  "pashto": "M₂V₂ = M₁V₁",
                  "sourcePdf": "D:/SpaceBook/Books/9th/9th Chemistry/pdf/chemistry4(1).pdf",
                  "sourcePdfPage": 14,
                  "sourcePrintedPage": 165
                },
                {
                  "text": "V₂ = M₁V₁ / M₂ = (3.5 × 85) / 0.41 = 725.60cm³",
                  "urdu": "V₂ = M₁V₁ / M₂ = (3.5 × 85) / 0.41 = 725.60cm³",
                  "pashto": "V₂ = M₁V₁ / M₂ = (3.5 × 85) / 0.41 = 725.60cm³",
                  "sourcePdf": "D:/SpaceBook/Books/9th/9th Chemistry/pdf/chemistry4(1).pdf",
                  "sourcePdfPage": 14,
                  "sourcePrintedPage": 165
                },
                {
                  "text": "Volume of solution = 725.60 − 85 = 640.60cm³",
                  "urdu": "محلول کا حجم = 725.60 − 85 = 640.60cm³",
                  "pashto": "د محلول حجم = 725.60 − 85 = 640.60cm³",
                  "sourcePdf": "D:/SpaceBook/Books/9th/9th Chemistry/pdf/chemistry4(1).pdf",
                  "sourcePdfPage": 14,
                  "sourcePrintedPage": 165
                },
                {
                  "text": "640.60cm³ needs to be added to get the diluted solution.",
                  "urdu": "رقیق محلول حاصل کرنے کے لیے 640.60cm³ شامل کرنا چاہیے۔",
                  "pashto": "د رقیق محلول ترلاسه کولو لپاره باید 640.60cm³ ورزیات شي.",
                  "sourcePdf": "D:/SpaceBook/Books/9th/9th Chemistry/pdf/chemistry4(1).pdf",
                  "sourcePdfPage": 14,
                  "sourcePrintedPage": 165
                }
