                  "text": "Mushtaq-ur-Rehman is working as lecturer in Chemistry Department at Govt. College Shabqader, Charsadda. He got his M.Phil Degree in Chemistry from N.C.E in Physical Chemistry from Peshawar University. He has attended numerous seminars and workshops related to education and development of Textbooks.",
